cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "r2py_rpart: a Python port of the R package rpart"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite all three of: the original R package
  rpart; the r2py conversion-method paper; and this port at the version you
  ran. The numerical core of r2py_rpart is rpart's own C code, retained
  unmodified. See the Citation section of the README for the full list.
